==History==
2017
*The Dart Goblin [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 13/1/2017 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (16/3/2017)|maintenance break]], decreased the Dart Goblin's attack time interval to 0.65 seconds (from 0.7 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}. This was done to fix some unexpected behaviour that the Dart Goblin showed.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Dart Goblin’s damage by 3% {{Balance|Buff}}. The update also slightly changed his description. It used to read “''Runs fast, shoots far and chews gum. How does he blow darts with a mouth full of gum? Years of didgeridoo lessons.''” {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11) {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Dart Goblin's damage by 4% {{Balance|Buff}}. This change was voted for by the community.
2019
*On 4/2/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Dart Goblin's attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.65 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and increased his first attack time interval to 0.35 seconds (from 0.3 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Dart Goblin's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], increased the Dart Goblin's damage by 9% {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], changed the Dart Goblin's card render {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], added the Efficient Attacker [[Card Mastery]] task for the Dart Goblin {{Balance|Add}}.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], increased the Dart Goblin’s damage by 8.4% {{Balance|Buff}}. It also added the Dart Goblin to the Goblin class {{Balance|Add}}.
2025
*On 6/1/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/1/2025)|January 2025 Update]], added the Dart Goblin's Evolution {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dart Goblin's damage by 5% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Dart Goblin's hitpoints by 0.38% {{Balance|Buff}}, and decreased his damage by 1.48% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Dart Goblin's Damage by 17% {{Balance|Buff}} and increased his attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.7 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026

* On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the dart goblins damage by 8%.
* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Dart Goblin's sight range to 7.5 tiles (from 7 tiles).

